Output demo/needle3-router.mp4
Output demo/needle3-router.gif
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set FontFamily "DejaVu Sans Mono"
Set Width 1080
Set Height 1080
Set FontSize 25
Set Framerate 20
Set PlaybackSpeed 1
Set Margin 24
Set MarginFill "#171620"
Set Padding 34
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set BorderRadius 16
Hide
Type "python3 demo/showcase.py"
Enter
Show
Wait+Screen@90s /DEMO COMPLETE/
Screenshot demo/needle3-router-cover.png
Sleep 1s
Hide
Ctrl+C
